<mxfile host="Electron">
  <diagram name="Trang-1" id="iWEkxYnAxCC0D-AHh45F">
    <mxGraphModel dx="3121" dy="2000" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n!theme plain\nautonumber\nskinparam BoxPadding 10\nskinparam ParticipantPadding 10\nskinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true\n\ntitle Sequence Diagram: UC-1 Login - SoundWave System\n\nactor Guest as \&quot;Guest\\n(Actor)\&quot;\n\nbox \&quot;Frontend Layer\&quot; #AliceBlue\n    participant FE as \&quot;Frontend (React)\\nLoginPage\&quot;\nend box\n\nbox \&quot;Backend Layer (Spring Boot)\&quot; #Snow\n    participant Ctrl as \&quot;AuthController\\n/api/v1/auth/login\&quot;\n    participant Svc as \&quot;AuthService\&quot;\n    participant PwEnc as \&quot;PasswordEncoder\\n(BCrypt)\&quot;\n    participant Jwt as \&quot;JwtTokenProvider\&quot;\n    participant UserRepo as \&quot;AppUserRepository\&quot;\n    participant TokenRepo as \&quot;RefreshTokenRepository\&quot;\nend box\n\ndatabase DB as \&quot;SQL Server\\nDatabase\&quot;\n\n== 1. Input Credentials &amp; Submit Request ==\n\nGuest -&gt; FE : Open Login screen (/login)\nactivate FE\nFE --&gt; Guest : Display login form (Email, Password, Remember Me)\ndeactivate FE\n\nGuest -&gt; FE : Enter Email, Password &amp; click [Login]\nactivate FE\n\nopt Client-side Form Validation Fails\n    FE --&gt; Guest : Display validation error (Empty / Invalid email format)\nend\n\nFE -&gt; Ctrl : POST /api/v1/auth/login (LoginRequestDto)\nactivate Ctrl\nnote over Ctrl: DTO Validation (@NotBlank, @Email)\n\nCtrl -&gt; Svc : login(loginRequestDto)\nactivate Svc\n\n== 2. Account Lookup &amp; Credential Verification ==\n\nSvc -&gt; UserRepo : findByEmailAndDeletedAtIsNull(email)\nactivate UserRepo\nUserRepo -&gt; DB : SELECT u.*, r.code AS role_code\\nFROM app_users u JOIN roles r ON r.id = u.role_id\\nWHERE u.email = ? AND u.deleted_at IS NULL\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; UserRepo : Return AppUser entity (with Role) / null\ndeactivate DB\nUserRepo --&gt; Svc : Optional&lt;AppUser&gt;\ndeactivate UserRepo\n\nalt #MistyRose EX01: Account Not Found or Invalid Password\n    Svc -&gt; PwEnc : matches(rawPassword, passwordHash)\n    activate PwEnc\n    PwEnc --&gt; Svc : false\n    deactivate PwEnc\n    Svc --&gt; Ctrl : Throw UnauthorizedException(\&quot;Invalid credentials\&quot;)\n    Ctrl --&gt; FE : 401 Unauthorized (ErrorResponseDto)\n    FE --&gt; Guest : Display generic inline error, remain on Login page\n\nelse #MistyRose BR-06: Locked/Banned Account (status == &#39;BANNED&#39;)\n    Svc --&gt; Ctrl : Throw AccountBannedException(\&quot;Account is banned\&quot;)\n    Ctrl --&gt; FE : 403 Forbidden (ErrorResponseDto)\n    FE --&gt; Guest : Display error: Account is locked by Administrator\n\nelse #MistyRose AF01 &amp; BR-01: Unverified Account (status == &#39;PENDING&#39; / email_verified_at == null)\n    Svc --&gt; Ctrl : Throw EmailNotVerifiedException(\&quot;Email not verified\&quot;)\n    Ctrl --&gt; FE : 403 Forbidden (ErrorResponseDto, canResendOtp=true)\n    FE --&gt; Guest : Deny access &amp; prompt to resend verification OTP\n\nelse #LightCyan NF01: Successful Login\n    Svc -&gt; PwEnc : matches(rawPassword, passwordHash)\n    activate PwEnc\n    PwEnc --&gt; Svc : true\n    deactivate PwEnc\n\n    &#39; Update last login timestamp\n    Svc -&gt; UserRepo : updateLastLoginAt(user.id)\n    activate UserRepo\n    UserRepo -&gt; DB : UPDATE app_users\\nSET last_login_at = SYSUTCDATETIME(), updated_at = SYSUTCDATETIME()\\nWHERE id = ?\n    activate DB\n    DB --&gt; UserRepo : Success\n    deactivate DB\n    UserRepo --&gt; Svc : OK\n    deactivate UserRepo\n\n    &#39; Token generation\n    Svc -&gt; Jwt : generateAccessToken(user, role)\n    activate Jwt\n    Jwt --&gt; Svc : accessToken (JWT)\n    deactivate Jwt\n\n    Svc -&gt; Jwt : generateRefreshToken(user)\n    activate Jwt\n    Jwt --&gt; Svc : rawRefreshToken &amp; tokenHash\n    deactivate Jwt\n\n    &#39; Persist hashed refresh token\n    Svc -&gt; TokenRepo : save(RefreshToken entity)\n    activate TokenRepo\n    TokenRepo -&gt; DB : INSERT INTO refresh_tokens (user_id, token_hash, expires_at, created_at)\\nVALUES (?, ?, ?, SYSUTCDATETIME())\n    activate DB\n    DB --&gt; TokenRepo : Success\n    deactivate DB\n    TokenRepo --&gt; Svc : OK\n    deactivate TokenRepo\n\n    Svc --&gt; Ctrl : AuthResponseDto(accessToken, userInfo, role, rawRefreshToken)\n    deactivate Svc\n\n    note over Ctrl : Set HttpOnly Cookie with refreshToken\n    Ctrl --&gt; FE : 200 OK (AuthResponseDto: { accessToken, user: { id, email, role } })\n    deactivate Ctrl\n\n    == 3. AF02: Role-Specific Redirection ==\n\n    alt role == &#39;LISTENER&#39;\n        FE --&gt; Guest : Save accessToken in state, redirect to / (Explore Music)\n    else role == &#39;STAFF&#39;\n        FE --&gt; Guest : Save accessToken in state, redirect to /staff (Staff Dashboard)\n    else role == &#39;ADMIN&#39;\n        FE --&gt; Guest : Save accessToken in state, redirect to /admin (Admin Dashboard)\n    end\nend\ndeactivate FE\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="2gj_eSlcfn0yPFQNq1LW-322">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
